<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK MAY 9 LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.47 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK MAY 9 LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.47 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 6.47 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for May 9			 5,500</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for May		6,362</p>
<p> Average reserves to May 5			    5,820</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,466</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
